# What `gcloud run deploy --source .` uploads to Cloud Build. Without this file
# gcloud would send the whole directory, which is about 37 MB of analysis data
# the image never opens — including `edges_anon.csv`, whose rows are one
# viewer's subscription history each. The build does not need it, so it does not
# get a copy. The Dockerfile's COPY lines are the real list; keep the two in step.

.git/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Analysis inputs and outputs.
*.csv
*.ipynb
*.xlsx

# Local tool caches and scratch.
.repowise/
.code-review-graph/
.agents/
.jp_fonts/
